OL,3,GNEWSANature reserve fire believed to be
OL,4,Aarson
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fire which ravaged about 20 sq m of a
OL,7,Fnature reserve was believed to have
OL,8,Fbeen started deliberately, a fire
OL,9,Fservice said.
OL,11,FThe blaze at Walkmill Meadows Nature
OL,12,FReserve off Salisbury Hill View in
OL,13,FMarket Drayton, Shropshire, was tackled
OL,14,Fby fire crews from 17:50 BST on Monday.
OL,16,FCrews were faced with a rapidly
OL,17,Fspreading fire with long grass,
OL,18,Fundergrowth and bracken on fire.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
